5
00:00:18.407 --> 00:00:21.940
Market! Say it with me. Market!

6
00:00:25.931 --> 00:00:29.414
Money! Say it with me. Money!

7
00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:36.833
Buy! Say it with me. Buy!

8
00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:44.133
Sell! Say it with me. Sell!

9
00:00:48.145 --> 00:00:51.462
Shop! Say it with me. Shop!

10
00:00:55.458 --> 00:00:58.958
Price! Say it with me. Price!

11
00:01:03.015 --> 00:01:06.715
Basket! Say it with me. Basket!

12
00:01:10.715 --> 00:01:14.132
