14
00:01:24.175 --> 00:01:28.673
Say it with me. How much is it? It is one dollar.

15
00:01:33.634 --> 00:01:39.054
Mother goes to the market with money to buy fruit. She puts everything in her basket.

16
00:01:39.104 --> 00:01:40.378
I like this story!

17
00:01:41.328 --> 00:01:46.688
