18
00:01:46.738 --> 00:01:47.888
Buy!

19
00:01:48.696 --> 00:01:54.201
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:54.251 --> 00:01:55.401
Price!

21
00:01:56.406 --> 00:02:01.827
Value corner: Friendship. Good friends care about each other and have fun together.

22
00:02:01.877 --> 00:02:03.594
I can show friendship too!

23
00:02:04.396 --> 00:02:11.722
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:11.772 --> 00:02:13.366
